      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚀 DevDeskApp All-in-One Suite\n**How it works:**\nThis workflow demonstrates real-world developer utilities running 100% locally with zero external server dependencies.\n\n### ⚡ Test with 1 Click:\nJust click **'Test workflow'** at the bottom — no webhook or API setup required! All sample data is pre-configured.",
