    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 HR & Business Math\n4. **Slugifier:** Cleans candidate name into URL-safe ID.\n5. **CTC Calculator:** Computes monthly take-home, employee/employer PF, professional tax, and income tax breakdown.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
